{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38542","headline":"和座主尚书春日郊居 · 吴融","name":"和座主尚书春日郊居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"海燕初归朔雁回，静眠深揜百花台。\n春蔬已爲高僧掇，腊酝还因熟客开。\n檐外暖丝兼絮堕，槛前轻浪带鸥来。\n谢公难避苍生意，自古风流必上台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38542.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38542","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}